"AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告规程"],"target":"7.3节中AE/SAE/SUSAR定义、分级、采集窗口、报告对象与时限"},{"action":"需访视操作手册或安全性评估计划明确各检查的时点与频率","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_73_visit_detail","missing_source_classes":["安全性评估访视操作细则"],"target":"7.3节中各安全性检查（生命体征、ECG、实验室）在各访视的具体实施安排"},{"action":"需方案剂量调整章节或IB安全性数据支持","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_73_dose_adjust","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整与暂停/恢复/永久停药规则"],"target":"7.3节中剂量调整、暂停、恢复及永久停药的具体触发条件与操作流程"},{"action":"需IB或既往临床/非临床安全性数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_73_drug_risk","missing_source_classes":["药物已知风险与IB安全性摘要"],"target":"7.3节中研究药物已知安全性风险及专项监测要求"}],"heading":"安全性评估","missing_source_classes":["AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告规程","安全性评估访视操作细则","剂量调整与暂停/恢复/永久停药规则","药物已知风险与IB安全性摘要"],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，治疗期12周，安全性评估贯穿整个研究期间。安全性评估的主要内容包括：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与体位性低血压；生命体征（血压、心率）；肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标；12导联心电图。安全性数据采用描述统计进行分析。本研究不设置独立数据安全监查委员会（DMC）或安全审查委员会（SRC）。每4周随访时评估受试者对研究药物的耐受性，并按方案规定进行剂量调整。安全性评价在V2（第4周）、V3（第8周）、V4（治疗结束，第12周±3天）及V5（安全随访，第14周）访视中实施，其中V4进行主要终点评价与全面安全性评估，V5进行不良事件转归确认。筛选期（V0）采集病史、体格检查、超声心动图、实验室检查、NT-proBNP及心电图作为基线安全性参考。","rationale":"安全性终点清单、访视策略中安全性评价节点、每4周耐受性评估、描述统计分析策略及DMC/SRC不设置均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。各安全性检查的具体实施时点、AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告规则、异常处理阈值等项目级实施细节缺少对应项目文件，需医学经理补充确认后方可定稿。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_d47bcd86666565b4","section_number":"7.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ac4202fef828bda28b99e933","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004155111_bc1bb141","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与体位性低血压；生命体征（血压、心率）；肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标；12导联心电图","quote_sha256":"e77501ca084e2f1e9fa18684d494f2252570a19a158da14e097274f13b01fb6b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"坐位SBP<90 mmHg或有症状性低血压","quote_sha256":"40a6e7a0987b390756f93f9d0f4cf33128698c0bc9d473e86c02696d575a31ae","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_exclusion_bp"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"SMOKE-r2-1Q口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC201）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服","quote_sha256":"280afa34e1c3f781fcdceed8627f4246b710b4c6aede478ac941a563ca1944cd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_drug_info"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"V0筛选（-28~-1d）：病史、查体、ECHO、实验室、NT-proBNP、ECG","quote_sha256":"90111573aff2e6c1b9e0788dc8223f116513fc23252ef181c835c23c89de487a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_v0_assessments"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoints","es_exclusion_bp","es_drug_info","es_v0_assessments"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"需项目安全性评估操作手册或访视操作细则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_731_vital_method","missing_source_classes":["生命体征测量操作规范"],"target":"7.3.1节中血压和心率的测量方法、体位、频率及异常处理"},{"action":"需访视操作手册明确体格检查项目与频率","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_731_physical_exam","missing_source_classes":["体格检查项目清单与实施时点"],"target":"7.3.1节中体格检查的完整项目清单及各访视实施安排"},{"action":"需IB或安全性管理规程提供低血压处理规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_731_hypotension_handling","missing_source_classes":["低血压异常处理与干预阈值"],"target":"7.3.1节中低血压事件的识别、分级、处理及停药标准"}],"heading":"生命体征和体格检查","missing_source_classes":["生命体征测量操作规范","体格检查项目清单与实施时点","低血压异常处理与干预阈值"],"proposal_text":"本研究将生命体征（血压、心率）列为安全性终点之一，在安全性评价访视中予以监测。鉴于研究药物KZ-sGC201为口服sGC刺激剂，具有血管扩张作用机制，且排除标准中明确将坐位收缩压低于90 mmHg或有症状性低血压列为排除条件，血压与心率监测为本研究安全性评估的重点关注项目。症状性低血压与体位性低血压作为独立安全性终点予以记录和评估。体格检查在筛选期（V0）作为基线评估的一部分实施，包括一般体格检查及心血管系统检查。","rationale":"生命体征（血压、心率）和症状性低血压/体位性低血压作为安全性终点、排除标准中坐位SBP<90 mmHg及症状性低血压条件、sGC刺激剂血管扩张机制均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。但生命体征的具体测量方法（坐位/卧位/立位）、测量频率、异常阈值、处理流程及体格检查的完整项目清单和具体实施时点未在允许来源中明确，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_aa5a3c26b51c1169","section_number":"7.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ac4202fef828bda28b99e933","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004155111_bc1bb141","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与体位性低血压；生命体征（血压、心率）；肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标；12导联心电图","quote_sha256":"e77501ca084e2f1e9fa18684d494f2252570a19a158da14e097274f13b01fb6b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"V0筛选（-28~-1d）：病史、查体、ECHO、实验室、NT-proBNP、ECG","quote_sha256":"90111573aff2e6c1b9e0788dc8223f116513fc23252ef181c835c23c89de487a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_v0_assessments"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"SMOKE-r2-1Q口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC201）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服","quote_sha256":"280afa34e1c3f781fcdceed8627f4246b710b4c6aede478ac941a563ca1944cd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_drug_info"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoints","es_v0_assessments","es_drug_info"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"需访视操作手册或安全性评估计划明确ECG采集安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_732_ecg_timing","missing_source_classes":["心电图采集操作规范"],"target":"7.3.2节中12导联心电图在各访视的具体采集时点与频率"},{"action":"需项目安全性评估规范或IB提供QTc评估要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_732_qtc_method","missing_source_classes":["QTc评估方法与异常判读标准"],"target":"7.3.2节中QTc评估方法选择及异常判读阈值"},{"action":"需安全性管理规程提供ECG异常处理规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_732_ecg_handling","missing_source_classes":["心电图异常处理流程"],"target":"7.3.2节中心电图异常的临床意义评估与处理流程"}],"heading":"心电图检查","missing_source_classes":["心电图采集操作规范","QTc评估方法与异常判读标准","心电图异常处理流程"],"proposal_text":"本研究将12导联心电图列为安全性终点之一。筛选期（V0）采集12导联心电图作为基线安全性参考。心电图检查在安全性评价访视中实施，用于监测研究药物对心脏电生理的潜在影响。鉴于KZ-sGC201为口服sGC刺激剂，其血管扩张作用可能引起反射性心率变化，心电图监测有助于识别心率异常及传导异常等安全性信号。","rationale":"12导联心电图作为安全性终点、V0筛选期采集ECG、sGC刺激剂血管扩张机制及可能引起反射性心率变化均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。但心电图的具体采集时点（是否每次安全性访视均采集）、QTc评估方法（QTcF或QTcB）、异常判读标准、临床意义评估规则及异常处理流程未在允许来源中明确，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_3534819bad2707df","section_number":"7.3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ac4202fef828bda28b99e933","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004155111_bc1bb141","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与体位性低血压；生命体征（血压、心率）；肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标；12导联心电图","quote_sha256":"e77501ca084e2f1e9fa18684d494f2252570a19a158da14e097274f13b01fb6b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_safety_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"V0筛选（-28~-1d）：病史、查体、ECHO、实验室、NT-proBNP、ECG","quote_sha256":"90111573aff2e6c1b9e0788dc8223f116513fc23252ef181c835c23c89de487a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_v0_assessments"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"eGFR<30 mL/min/1.73m²；ALT/AST>3×ULN","quote_sha256":"3707a89487dfed78a766cf1668e3099815f822cceb49bb843600518e7fc56ce4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_exclusion_lab"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_safety_endpoints","es_v0_assessments","es_exclusion_lab"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"需项目实验室检查计划或访视操作手册明确具体检测项目","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_733_lab_panel","missing_source_classes":["实验室检查项目清单与采集时点"],"target":"7.3.3节中实验室检查的完整项目清单（血常规、肝肾功能、电解质、凝血、NT-proBNP等）"},{"action":"需访视操作手册明确实验室检查安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_733_lab_timing","missing_source_classes":["实验室检查项目清单与采集时点"],"target":"7.3.3节中实验室检查在各访视的具体采集时点与频率"},{"action":"需安全性管理规程或IB提供实验室异常处理规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_733_lab_handling","missing_source_classes":["实验室异常处理阈值与复查规则"],"target":"7.3.3节中实验室异常的处理阈值、复查要求及停药标准"}],"heading":"实验室检查","missing_source_classes":["实验室检查项目清单与采集时点","实验室异常处理阈值与复查规则"],"proposal_text":"本研究将肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标列为安全性终点。筛选期（V0）采集实验室检查作为基线安全性参考。排除标准中明确将eGFR低于30 mL/min/1.73m²及ALT/AST超过3倍正常值上限列为排除条件，提示肝肾功能为本研究安全性监测的重点关注领域。实验室检查在安全性评价访视中实施，用于监测研究药物对肝肾功能及电解质平衡的潜在影响。","rationale":"肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标作为安全性终点、V0筛选期采集实验室检查、排除标准中eGFR<30和ALT/AST>3×ULN条件均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。但实验室检查的完整项目清单（是否包含血常规、凝血功能、NT-proBNP等）、各访视具体采集时点、异常处理阈值及复查规则未在允许来源中明确，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_26b6860aaafd9336","section_number":"7.3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ac4202fef828bda28b99e933","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e